DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
32210::$$$message_0255_0000_0000$$$::There are barely any people by the train station.[lr]::
32211::$$$message_0255_0000_0001$$$::Rush hour ended long ago.[lr]::
32212::$$$message_0255_0000_0002$$$::At this time, I'd guess we would only see someone come out of the station every thirty minutes or so.[lr]::
32213::$$$message_0255_0000_0003$$$::Still, it's a problem that there are pedestrians at all.::
32214::$$$message_0255_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou? What's the matter? Why are you squeezing the bridge of your nose while you look at me?"[lr]::
32215::$$$message_0255_0001_0001$$$::Case in point.[lr]::
32216::$$$message_0255_0001_0002$$$::While it was good that we didn't see any foot traffic in Miyama, she stands out way too much in front of the train station.::
32217::$$$message_0255_0002_0000$$$::"It's nothing. Looks like everything's normal here. We should move on."[lr]::
32218::$$$message_0255_0002_0001$$$::"But we just arrived. In the past, we would have checked the office park and then the industrial area.[lr]::
32219::$$$message_0255_0002_0002$$$::It's uncharacteristic of you to be so lax in your investigation. Where is your usual caution and attention to detail?"::
32220::$$$message_0255_0003_0000$$$::"Hm... Yeah, you're right."[lr]::
32221::$$$message_0255_0003_0001$$$::I'm aware that this isn't like me.[lr]::
32222::$$$message_0255_0003_0002$$$::To begin with, I can't really work up the motivation to go on this patrol for the sake of patrolling.[lr]::
32223::$$$message_0255_0003_0003$$$::I wonder what Saber thinks about it.::
32224::$$$message_0255_0004_0000$$$::"Hey, Saber. What do you think of this patrol?"[lr]::
32225::$$$message_0255_0004_0001$$$::"I'm not sure what you mean. My priority is to help you. Although I'm curious about the strange events, I don't sense any hostility toward the city itself from those responsible.[lr]::
32226::$$$message_0255_0004_0002$$$::After all, all these incidents have been..."[lr]::
32227::$$$message_0255_0004_0003$$$::Been...what?[lr]::
32228::$$$message_0255_0004_0004$$$::Saber goes meaningfully silent. ::
32229::$$$message_0255_0005_0000$$$::"Saber? Come on, now you've got me curious. Don't just cut yourself off to bully me like Tohsaka does."::
32230::$$$message_0255_0006_0000$$$::"That's not my intent... But even if there were an enemy who means us ill...one can only conclude that it all seems to be directed at you, Shirou.[lr]::
32231::$$$message_0255_0006_0001$$$::It's possible that the other Servants are targeting you, just as Archer did when he sniped at you."::
32232::$$$message_0255_0007_0000$$$::"Ugh. I mean, that would be scary, but I thought we checked with everyone else. Most of them don't want to fight in the war, so I think they're fine.[lr]::
32233::$$$message_0255_0007_0001$$$::Archer's the only exception. He's hostile to me, for whatever reason."::
32234::$$$message_0255_0008_0000$$$::"...I see. So Archer views you as his only enemy."[lr]::
32235::$$$message_0255_0008_0001$$$::Saber thinks for a moment.::
32236::$$$message_0255_0009_0000$$$::"Shirou, I think this bears investigating. While nothing was amiss in Miyama, we should be able to find clues in Shinto."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
32237::$$$message_0255_0010_0000$$$::Saber makes for the city square with newfound enthusiasm.[lr]::
32238::$$$message_0255_0010_0001$$$::She's scary enough when she gets aggressive, but having her drag me around town in that outfit is scary, too.[lr]::
32239::$$$message_0255_0010_0002$$$::It's a herculean task to stop Saber once she's in this mood.[lr]::
32240::$$$message_0255_0010_0003$$$::Oh, well. I might as well go ahead and search the office buildings like she suggested.::

